{#- _chat.html.j2 — the site assistant's launcher (owner decision 2026-10-13, CLAUDE.md 3.10), included once by
    base.html.j2 at the end of <body> on every page of every language (lang: ko, en and, when their pages exist, ja,
    zh-Hans, zh-Hant, de, fr, es, ru; any other falls back to English). It is only this button: assets/site.js loads
    assets/chat.js + assets/chat.css on its first press, or after load when this tab left the chat open on the
    previous page — nothing else of the chat is in the first paint (its rules are css/49-chat.css). Hidden without JS.
    Any other element with data-chat-open opens the chat too.
    Owner 2026-10-13 night ('챗봇 버튼을 조금 더 크게', the mascot B): a round button with the mascot's face
    (_mascot.html.j2, mascot-icon-3d at 1× and 2×, width/height set) on every page from the first paint. Owner
    2026-10-14 ('우측 하단에 지금 뭔지 잘 모르겠는데, AI 챗봇인 거 더 크게 잘 보이면 좋겠네'): bigger (68px, 84px from
    1024px) and always labelled — the words 'AI 챗봇' (in each language) on a sea-blue tag across the bottom of the
    circle, at every width. The accessible name starts with that label and says what it is for.
    UI4 (owner 2026-10-14: '첫 화면부터 우측 하단에 챗봇 잘 보이게'): visible bottom-right at load on every page and
    every width, above every other fixed thing — except on the homes below 1024px, where it steps aside while their
    own question box is on screen (operator 2026-10-15: at 390x844 it covered the box's '#' tags; css/49-chat.css,
    site.js html.ask-out). On the Korean pages from 1024px the floating quick menu sits above it (css/49-chat.css): a white vertical
    pill with the few real actions — 검색, 지도, 행사 달력 (on a place page 길찾기, its own block), 맨 위로 (#main-content,
    the top of the page's content, without JS too) — 44px round targets with their names (aria-label + title, a tooltip on hover/focus);
    it comes after the footer in the reading order. Phones: only the launcher. -#}
{#- base.html.j2 includes this twice (QA 2026-10-19 QA-49: the launcher was the last of 68 tab stops on a place
    page): chat_part 'fab' right after the header — the launcher alone, early in the reading and tab order —, then
    'rest' after the footer — the quick menu and the pictures. Without chat_part, everything at once. -#}
{% set chat_part = chat_part if chat_part is defined else '' %}
{% import "_mascot.html.j2" as mm %}
{% set region_ko = site.region if site is defined and site and site.region else '' %}
{% set chat_ui = {
  'ko': ('AI 챗봇', 'AI 챗봇 — ' ~ ((region_ko ~ ' ') if region_ko else '') ~ '여행 질문하기'),
  'en': ('AI chat', 'AI chat — ask a travel question'),
  'ja': ('AIチャット', 'AIチャット — 旅行について質問する'),
  'zh-Hans': ('AI助手', 'AI助手 — 提出旅行问题'),
  'zh-Hant': ('AI助手', 'AI助手 — 提出旅行問題'),
  'de': ('KI-Chat', 'KI-Chat — Fragen zur Reise'),
  'fr': ('Chat IA', 'Chat IA — une question sur le voyage'),
  'es': ('Chat IA', 'Chat IA — preguntar sobre el viaje'),
  'ru': ('ИИ-чат', 'ИИ-чат — вопрос о поездке'),
} %}
{% set cl = chat_ui.get(lang) or chat_ui['en'] %}
{% if lang == 'ko' and site is defined and chat_part != 'fab' %}{% import "_ui.html.j2" as qui %}
{% set QM = [('search', '검색', '/search/') if has_search else none, ('map', '지도', '/map/') if has_map else none,
             ('route', '길찾기', ctxbtn[1]) if ctxbtn and ctxbtn[1] == '#h-dir' else (('calendar', '행사 달력', '/events/') if has_events else none),
             ('up', '맨 위로', '#main-content')] %}
<nav class="qm" aria-label="빠른 메뉴"><ul>{% for it in QM if it %}<li><a class="qm-i" href="{{ it[2] }}" aria-label="{{ it[1] }}" title="{{ it[1] }}" data-tip="{{ it[1] }}">{{ qui.icon(it[0]) }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul></nav>
{% endif %}
{#- the city's words for chat.js (site.json city.chat: names {lang: city name}, chips {lang: [starter questions]}), the
    public address it turns links into on-site paths for, and the Korean site search it offers while the assistant is
    not set up (data-chat-search: '' when the build has no search page) -#}
{% set chat_cfg = ((site.city or {}).chat or {}) if site is defined and site else {} %}
{#- the planner's start and end points ({key: name}, site.json city.plan.hubs): planQuery reads a time said at one -#}
{% set plan_hub_names = {} %}{% if site is defined and site %}{% for h in ((site.city or {}).plan or {}).hubs or [] %}{% if h.key and h.name %}{% set _ = plan_hub_names.update({h.key: h.name}) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}
{% if chat_part != 'rest' %}<button type="button" class="chat-fab" data-chat-open aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="{{ cl[1] }}" data-chat-site="{{ site.site_url if site is defined and site else '' }}" data-chat-search="{{ '/search/' if has_search is defined and has_search else '' }}" data-chat-city="{{ (chat_cfg.names or {})|tojson|forceescape }}" data-chat-chips="{{ (chat_cfg.chips or {})|tojson|forceescape }}" data-chat-hubs="{{ plan_hub_names|tojson|forceescape }}"><span class="chat-fab-face">{{ mm.pic('mascot-icon-3d', 'icon', 52, glyph='chat') }}</span><span class="chat-fab-l">{{ cl[0] }}</span></button>{% endif %}
{#- the assistant's pictures, copied by assets/chat.js where it shows them (inside a <template> nothing loads until
    then): the first screen's illustration (chat.empty, in the page's language: art_slots is art.for_lang's — never on a
    place page, where AI art may not be at all, CLAUDE.md 4), the mascot thinking beside '답을 찾는 중…' and sorry
    beside an error. Only what this site has; nothing at all without them. -#}
{% if chat_part != 'fab' %}{% import "_art.html.j2" as artm %}
{% set on_place = page_kind is defined and page_kind is string and page_kind.startswith('place-') %}
{% set chat_art = (art_slots or {}).get('chat.empty') if art_slots is defined and not on_place else none %}
{% set chat_think = mm.pic('mascot-think', 'small', 40, 'chat-mascot')|trim %}{% set chat_sorry = mm.pic('mascot-sorry', 'small', 48, 'chat-mascot')|trim %}
{% if (chat_art and chat_art.alts.get(lang)) or chat_think or chat_sorry %}<template id="chat-art">{% if chat_art and chat_art.alts.get(lang) %}<div data-id="hello">{{ artm.figure(chat_art, lang, '(min-width: 600px) 400px, calc(100vw - 40px)', cls='chat-art', decorative=true) }}</div>{% endif %}{% if chat_think %}<span data-id="think">{{ chat_think }}</span>{% endif %}{% if chat_sorry %}<span data-id="sorry">{{ chat_sorry }}</span>{% endif %}</template>{% endif %}{% endif %}
